[0.000, "o", "=== draft protocol (out/draft_protocol.md) ===\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "# Draft Verification Protocol — Novapump NP-200 (synthetic)\r\n\r\n> **DRAFT — requires engineer review. Not for execution.**\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Origin tags: **NEW** = drafted for NP-200; **REUSED (L-nn)** = legacy step carried over verbatim, still traces cleanly; **RETIRED** steps are listed at the end with the reason.\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Delivery\r\n\r\n| Step | Action | Expected Result | Traces To |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| TC-001 · NEW | Review the delivery modes offered by the pump (Adult profile active) and select each in turn. | The pump supports exactly four delivery modes: Basal, Bolus, Extended Bolus, and Suspen\r\n| TC-002 · REUSED (L-01) | Open Basal settings and enter a rate of 1.00 U/h | Pump accepts and displays 1.00 U/h | NP-REQ-002 |\r\n| TC-003 · REUSED (L-02) | Enter a basal rate of 5.00 U/h then try 5.05 U/h | 5.00 U/h accepted; 5.05 U/h rejected | NP-REQ-002 |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| TC-004 · REUSED (L-03) | Run programmed basal for 24 hours and measure delivered volume | Delivered volume within ±5% of programmed | NP-REQ-003 |\r\n| TC-005 · REUSED (L-05) | Select Bolus and confirm 2.00 U | Delivery starts within 2 seconds and 2.00 U is delivered | NP-REQ-004 |\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "...\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "## Retired from legacy protocol (NP-100)\r\n\r\n| Legacy Step | Action | Why it was not reused |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| L-04 | Select Temp Basal mode and set 150% for 1 hour | Temp Basal mode no longer exists; current modes are Basal, Bolus, Extended Bolus, Suspend. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-06 | Request a 21 U bolus | Maximum bolus changed: 20 U limit replaced by profile limits (Adult above 25 U rejected with \"Bolus exceeds limit\"; Pediatric limits in NP\r\n| L-07 | Press Up Down and OK to reach the Settings menu | Up, Down and OK keys no longer exist; buttons are Bolus, Suspend/Resume, Menu, Back. |\r\n| L-08 | Press the Quick Bolus button once | Quick Bolus button no longer exists. |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "| L-09 | Hold the Power button for 3 seconds | Power button no longer exists in the current button set. |\r\n| L-12 | Select Priming mode and run a prime cycle | Priming mode no longer exists in the current requirements. |\r\n| L-13 | Select Square Wave and set 4 U over 2 hours | Square Wave bolus replaced by Extended Bolus (duration 30 min to 8 h); legacy mode name and 4 U/2 h values no longe\r\n| L-17 | Press the OK button during an active alarm | OK button no longer exists; alarm is silenced with the Back button. |\r\n| L-19 | Open Settings and set the date and time | Expected result (date/time shown on home screen) is not in the current requirements, which now specify 1-minute resolut\r\n"]
